&lt;p&gt;Detailed drawings/full particulars of the proposed windows showing the matters set out below must be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority, in writing, before any work is commenced. The development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with the details thus approved which shall be implemented in full prior to the first occupation/use of the development and retained in perpetuity (if necessary).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
a) Details of replacement windows replicating the detailing of the original windows including the lead glazing bars&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
REASON:&amp;nbsp;To ensure that the external appearance of the building is satisfactory and does not detract from the character and visual amenity of the locally listed building.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
